# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must stay that way.
#
# Both variables are required together. With either missing the app runs in
# local-only mode: no sync, no spectators, no realtime.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC by design. It ships inside the app binary and row-level
# security is what protects writes. It is not a secret; it is a public
# identifier. The service_role key is a different matter entirely and must
# never appear in this file, this repository, or any build.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
